    "content": "# ============================================================================\n[connectivity]\nnk=subgraph_kernel_plan5_v1:1:siu_core_v5\n\n# HBM Bank Mapping\n# Phase-1 mapping: keep one (v1,v2) bank pair per PE, and fan out to L0~L4 ports.\n# PE0 -\u003e HBM[0]/HBM[1]\nsp=siu_core_v5.gmem_pe0_v1_L0:HBM[0]\nsp=siu_core_v5.gmem_pe0_v2_L0:HBM[0]\nsp=siu_core_v5.gmem_pe0_v1_L1:HBM[1]\nsp=siu_core_v5.gmem_pe0_v2_L1:HBM[1]\nsp=siu_core_v5.gmem_pe0_v1_L2:HBM[2]\nsp=siu_core_v5.gmem_pe0_v2_L2:HBM[2]\nsp=siu_core_v5.gmem_pe0_v1_L3:HBM[3]\nsp=siu_core_v5.gmem_pe0_v2_L3:HBM[3]\nsp=siu_core_v5.gmem_pe0_v1_L4:HBM[4]\nsp=siu_core_v5.gmem_pe0_v2_L4:HBM[4]\n\n# PE1 -\u003e HBM[2]/HBM[3]\nsp=siu_core_v5.gmem_pe1_v1_L0:HBM[6]\nsp=siu_core_v5.gmem_pe1_v2_L0:HBM[6]\nsp=siu_core_v5.gmem_pe1_v1_L1:HBM[7]\nsp=siu_core_v5.gmem_pe1_v2_L1:HBM[7]\nsp=siu_core_v5.gmem_pe1_v1_L2:HBM[8]\nsp=siu_core_v5.gmem_pe1_v2_L2:HBM[8]\nsp=siu_core_v5.gmem_pe1_v1_L3:HBM[9]\nsp=siu_core_v5.gmem_pe1_v2_L3:HBM[9]\nsp=siu_core_v5.gmem_pe1_v1_L4:HBM[10]\nsp=siu_core_v5.gmem_pe1_v2_L4:HBM[10]\n\n# PE2 -\u003e HBM[4]/HBM[5]\nsp=siu_core_v5.gmem_pe2_v1_L0:HBM[11]\nsp=siu_core_v5.gmem_pe2_v2_L0:HBM[11]\nsp=siu_core_v5.gmem_pe2_v1_L1:HBM[12]\nsp=siu_core_v5.gmem_pe2_v2_L1:HBM[12]\nsp=siu_core_v5.gmem_pe2_v1_L2:HBM[13]\nsp=siu_core_v5.gmem_pe2_v2_L2:HBM[13]\nsp=siu_core_v5.gmem_pe2_v1_L3:HBM[14]\nsp=siu_core_v5.gmem_pe2_v2_L3:HBM[14]\nsp=siu_core_v5.gmem_pe2_v1_L4:HBM[15]\nsp=siu_core_v5.gmem_pe2_v2_L4:HBM[15]\n\n# PE3 -\u003e HBM[6]/HBM[7]\nsp=siu_core_v5.gmem_pe3_v1_L0:HBM[16]\nsp=siu_core_v5.gmem_pe3_v2_L0:HBM[16]\nsp=siu_core_v5.gmem_pe3_v1_L1:HBM[17]\nsp=siu_core_v5.gmem_pe3_v2_L1:HBM[17]\nsp=siu_core_v5.gmem_pe3_v1_L2:HBM[18]\nsp=siu_core_v5.gmem_pe3_v2_L2:HBM[18]\nsp=siu_core_v5.gmem_pe3_v1_L3:HBM[19]\nsp=siu_core_v5.gmem_pe3_v2_L3:HBM[19]\nsp=siu_core_v5.gmem_pe3_v1_L4:HBM[20]\nsp=siu_core_v5.gmem_pe3_v2_L4:HBM[20]\n\nsp=siu_core_v5.gmem_row_ptr_pe0:HBM[21]\nsp=siu_core_v5.gmem_row_ptr_pe1:H